{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Invitation</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Thank you for your voluntary participation in this research experiment.<br>You must decide whether this is your living room, or merely a dream.<br>If it is a dream, swallow the medicine and awaken.<br>If it is reality, open the door and finish the experiment.<br>*<i>This study was conducted in strict compliance with research ethics guidelines.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Introduction</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Desomnia is a mystery walking simulation inspired by anomaly games such as The Exit 8. It offers about 30-120 minutes of gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Overview</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You participate in an experiment with your memory lost.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You fall asleep in the same space as your living room and wake up soon after.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have to determine if you are dreaming or if you are back to reality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The only way to wake up from your dream is to take the given medicine and collapse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete the experiment successfully.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Collections</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find all anomalies \u2014 perhaps there is something more.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Deja vu","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3988380/4f63ac841cd26e897065ed95ac9d73fd056ca144.jpg"},{"name":"Eden's Temptation","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3988380/0e32bd3175553366f4f6a55a5b985b4f0897111b.jpg"},{"name":"Still Alive","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3988380/6cc064806dbfb71dd0d29be19fd11683129ea097.jpg"},{"name":"Occupied","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3988380/ad1c353d35c8