nd awaken.<br>If it is reality, open the door and finish the experiment.<br>*<i>This study was conducted in strict compliance with research ethics guidelines.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Introduction</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Desomnia is a mystery walking simulation inspired by anomaly games such as The Exit 8. It offers about 30-120 minutes of gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Overview</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You participate in an experiment with your memory lost.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You fall asleep in the same space as your living room and wake up soon after.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have to determine if you are dreaming or if you are back to reality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The only way to wake up from your dream is to take the given medicine and collapse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete the experiment successfully.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Collections</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find all anomalies \u2014 perhaps there is something more.</p>","developers":["Doubleline Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988380/ee08aed0184a55f2a26b8628d75c492390997398/header.jpg?t=1758337206","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"name":"Desomnia","package_groups":[{"description":"","display_type":0,"is_recurring_subscription":"false","name":"default","save_text":"","selection_text":"Select a purchase option","subs":[{"can_get_free_license":"0","is_free_license":false,"option_description":"","option_text":"Desomnia - $1.99 USD","packageid":1399935,"percent_savings":0,"percent_savings_text":" ","price_in_cents_with_discount":199}],"title":"Buy Desomnia"}],"packages":[1399935],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</s